  "description": "Watch now (2 mins) | Markets are nearing all -time highs, sector rotation is playing out, and a midweek mover just triggered my entry",
  "body_html": "<p>Happy Tuesday! As mentioned last week, I was optimistic that the markets would continue pushing upwards. Today, we are ~.3% away from all time highs! Our best stock, Xometry, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$XMTR&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>, just broke above 51% gains, and we have been compounding this winner on the way up. Overall, pretty darn happy!</p><p>Has every one of our stocks rocketed up? No…Yesterday, I reviewed all of our <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/i-reviewed-every-stock-we-own-heres\">current positions (click here)</a></strong>. After that review, many of them are still “baking” as id like to say. Just because a stock is not running upwards now, does not mean it will not later on. Hence why I shared the sector rotation discussion in the video: Finance typically leads (we targeted Finance in January and February this year), and now Tech is making a run for it, something we started to strength and reversals in last month. So if you have a “dud”, but it still has a great chart structure, maybe just be patient. Your sector is upcoming for a bull leg. </p><p>That said, one of our Midweek Movers winning stocks alerted today, and I will be picking that up. More details down below. </p><p>But before that stock, quick question: Which platform do you use more? Click on the poll below…</p><div class=\"poll-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;id&quot;:1425714}\" data-component-name=\"PollToDOM\"></div><p>Substack is my “primary” platform, TikTok is my “secondary”… I know, its a bit crazy considering I have 588,000 followers there. But not all “followers” are the same. I have met many of you through TikTok, and many of you are amazing! But when it comes to <em><strong>general</strong></em> experiences, I am sick of TikTok. The barrage of ads, the bots, the censoring of content. I’m done with it. I find most joy in posting content and interactions with you all, here on Substack. I care about <em><strong>quality</strong></em> of followers, not quantity. </p><p>That said: I like having a “secondary” platform. So tell me which you prefer, YouTube, Reddit or X please. </p><h4>Ok, back  to the stock I am picking up. This was the <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/reviewed-27-stocks-one-made-the-cut\">06 August Midweek Mover Winner</a>, and it just broke out today… </h4>",
  "has_dynamic_content": false,
  "truncated_body_text": "Happy Tuesday! As mentioned last week, I was optimistic that the markets would continue pushing upwards. Today, we are ~.3% away from all time highs! Our best stock, Xometry, , just broke above 51% gains, and we have been compounding this winner on the way up. Overall, pretty darn happy!",
